---
question: que-es-verificar
questionEs: "¿Qué es verificar a un adoptante?"
questionEn: "What does it mean to vet an adopter?"
answerEn: "Vetting an adopter means checking their history before handing over an animal. This includes searching for
previous adoption records, warnings, or reports from other shelters and rescuers."
order: 1
---

Verificar a un adoptante significa revisar su historial antes de entregar un animal. Esto incluye buscar registros
previos de adopción, advertencias o reportes de otros refugios y rescatistas.